  "economy": {
    "canonical_prices": [],
    "price_claims": [
      {
        "text": "In the aperture it is shaped like a cockroach: a dark-brown flat body, with feelers on its head and wings on its back.",
        "chapters": [
          292
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-price",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Later refinement material copies repeat the same cockroach shape and dark brown flat body with feelers and wings.",
        "chapters": [
          1570
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-price",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In his aperture it looks like a cockroach: dark brown, flat body, feelers on its head, and wings on its back. He bought this rank three healing Gu for a huge outlay of primeval stones. A rare copy prices at forty-five thousand primeval stones, above sword shadow Gu in that comparison.",
        "chapters": [
          292
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-price",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_sword_shadow_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It is among the best Gu for strength cultivating Gu Masters. The greater the Gu Master’s physical strength, the stronger the healing; the weaker the body, the weaker the heal. It heals only the Gu Master who owns it, never others. With the strength of two boars, one bear, and a crocodile, Fang Yuan’s use sits on par with Flesh-bone Gu, and further strength gains can push it past that mark.",
        "chapters": [
          292
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-price",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_masters",
          "gu_flesh_bone_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Healing can overwrite other Gu law layers already in the body. While Steel Tendon Gu hardens tendons, reconnection is slower because Self-reliance Gu must also overcome that steel-tendon law fragment.",
        "chapters": [
          292
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-price",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_steel_tendon_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Hei tribe goods offer a rare rank two Self-reliance Gu. The rank three price sits at forty-five thousand primeval stones, or forty-five hundred battle merits there, while a rank four copy can price like a rank five Gu and rarely appears. He buys the rank two lot as a foundation for later refinement if no better path opens.",
        "chapters": [
          517
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "healing-power-over-time",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_hei_tribe"
        ],
        "needs_review": true
      }
    ],
    "game_proposals": []
  },
