  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After he loses Nine Leaf Vitality Grass, Fang Yuan lists rank three healing Gu he wants, including Endless Vitality Gu and Undying Grass alongside Self-reliance Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          161
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_nine_leaf_vitality_grass",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_healing_gu",
          "gu_vitality_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After he becomes a Gu Immortal, Self-reliance Gu remains among the second aperture mortal Gu that underpin killer move Myriad Self beside rank four All-out Effort Gu and other strength Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          650
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "myriad-self-component",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "sys_mortal_gu",
          "move_myriad_self"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When he uses immortal killer move Myriad Self, First Style, Giant Hand, the aperture again lists it among the circling mortal Gu around Self Strength Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          782
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "myriad-self-component",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "move_myriad_self_giant_hand",
          "gu_self_strength"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Even when Myriad Self’s core Immortal Gu are Self Strength, Pulling Mountain, Pulling Water, and Cleanse Soul, Self-reliance Gu is still named among the supplementary mortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1561
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "myriad-self-component",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "gu_pulling_mountain",
          "gu_pulling_water",
          "gu_cleanse_soul"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During refinement of myriad self Immortal Gu, Third Hair tosses in rank three Self-reliance Gu first; Sixth Hair adds several hundreds, and the calculated count is treated as a dao mark quantity problem before the copies burn into an odd rock. Self-reliance Gu is a strength path Gu worm with healing effects, cockroach-shaped, and those copies serve as refinement material.",
        "chapters": [
          1570
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "myriad-self-component",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_myriad_self_immortal_gu",
          "char_third_hair",
          "char_sixth_hair",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A later comparison of old Myriad Self still lists Self-reliance Gu among the many mortal Gu the move once needed.",
        "chapters": [
          1571
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "myriad-self-component",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan recreates the original mortal Myriad Self for comparison, he again lists it among the supplements under rank four All-out Effort Gu as core.",
        "chapters": [
          1774
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "myriad-self-component",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
